// Mei Weather - a weather channel for the Mei console.
//
// Tunes in to MeiNet, the console's Teletext-style data broadcast (docs/BROADCAST.md), and
// shows the weather like a late-90s cable weather channel: current conditions, the 5-day and
// 24-hour forecasts, and temperature maps dotted with the cities' own weather, for home and
// eight US regions. Type a page number on the remote, let the idle tour cycle the pages, and
// the last pages received come back from the memory card when there is no signal (the browser
// never has one: there, a recorded sample tape plays).
//
// The app is in app.akr, so the test scenarios (tests/) can import it with scripted input.
// Art: tools/gen_weather_assets.py; music and sounds: tools/gen_weather_audio.py.
cart "Mei Weather", "MEI-WEATHER"

import "app.akr"
